---
pagination:
  data: softwareIndex.categoryPages
  size: 1
  alias: cat
  addAllPagesToCollections: true
permalink: "{{ cat.url }}"
layout: layout.njk
eleventyComputed:
  title: "{{ cat.name | safe }} software"
  seo_title: "{{ cat.name | safe }} Software for Film and TV: {{ cat.count }} Compared | Tubes"
  description: "{{ cat.count }} {{ cat.name | lower | safe }} products for film, TV and media production, with what each one does, who it is for and what the vendor publishes about pricing."
---
{#- Categoriepagina. Mikt op zoekvragen als "production accounting software" en
    leidt door naar de productpagina's. -#}
<article class="section theme-light company-page">
  <div class="container company-inner">
    <nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
      <a href="/">Home</a> <span aria-hidden="true">/</span>
      <a href="/software/">Software</a> <span aria-hidden="true">/</span>
      <span aria-current="page">{{ cat.name }}</span>
    </nav>
    <header class="company-head">
      <p class="company-kicker"><a href="/software/">Directory</a></p>
      <h1>{{ cat.name }} software for film and TV</h1>
      <p class="company-summary">{{ cat.blurb }} {{ cat.count }} products listed, each recorded from what the vendor publishes itself. Filter and put three side by side in the <a href="/compare-media-software/">comparison tool</a>.</p>
    </header>

    <h2>How they are delivered</h2>
    <ul class="company-chips">
      {%- for d in cat.byDeployment %}
      <li><span class="company-chip-flat">{{ d.deployment }} <span>{{ d.count }}</span></span></li>
      {%- endfor %}
    </ul>

    <h2>The products</h2>
    <div class="software-cards">
      {%- for p in cat.products %}
      <article class="software-card">
        <h3><a href="/software/{{ p.id }}/">{{ p.name }}</a></h3>
        <p class="software-card-vendor">{{ p.vendor }}{% if p.vendor_country %}, {{ p.vendor_country }}{% endif %} &middot; {{ p.deployment }}</p>
        <p>{{ p.summary }}</p>
        {%- if p.for_whom %}<p class="software-card-meta"><strong>Built for:</strong> {{ p.for_whom }}</p>{% endif %}
        <p class="software-card-meta"><strong>Pricing:</strong> {{ p.pricing_model }}</p>
      </article>
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>

    <p class="company-back">
      <a href="/software/">All categories</a> &middot;
      <a href="/compare-media-software/">Search all {{ softwareIndex.total }} products</a> &middot;
      <a href="/companies/">Company directory</a>
    </p>
  </div>
</article>

<section class="section theme-teal">
  <div class="container company-cta">
    <h2>Working in production?</h2>
    <p>Tubes brings budgeting, planning and cost control together in one platform, connected to the accounting system you already use.</p>
    <p><a class="button button-primary" href="/contact/">Request a Demo</a></p>
  </div>
</section>
